(4) DAT carrier onboarding guide (carrier network revenue value, abandonment rate): https://www.dat.com/resources/carrier-onboarding-guide
(5) Montgomery v. Caribe Transport II, LLC — Supreme Court ruling May 14, 2026, FreightWaves: https://www.freightwaves.com/news/the-supreme-court-just-told-every-freight-broker-that-they-can-be-sued
(6) Montgomery ruling — broker CSA vetting implications, TruckSafe analysis: https://trucksafe.com/post/montgomery-v-caribe-scotus-csa-score-broker-vetting
(7) FMCSA 2024 Pocket Guide to Large Truck and Bus Statistics: https://www.fmcsa.dot.gov/sites/fmcsa.dot.gov/files/2025-09/FMCSA%20Pocket%20Guide%202024-v6%20508%20.pdf
