(7) Highway Q2 2025 Freight Fraud Index (135% MC ownership change spike): https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2025/07/29/3123318/0/en/Highway-Releases-Q2-2025-Freight-Fraud-Index-Identity-Based-Fraud-Attempts-Escalate-with-495K-Blocked-Emails-and-42K-Fraudulent-Calls.html
