(9) BSI Consulting / TT Club 2024 Cargo Theft Report (PDF, processed via markitdown) — strategic theft 18% of US incidents, fictitious thefts rose from 1% (2022) to 17% (2023) of US cargo thefts, double/triple brokering listed as contributing tactic. Report PDF: https://www.ttclub.com/fileadmin/uploads/tt-club/Documents/files/tt-club/bsi-tt-club-cargo-theft-report/tt-club-report-supply-chain-report-april-2024-final.pdf ; landing page: https://www.ttclub.com/news-and-resources/publications/article/bsi-consulting-and-tt-club-2024-cargo-theft-report/
(13) Truckstop load-board 400% double-brokering complaint spike Q4 2022–Q1 2023, attributed to Brent Hutto (Truckstop CRO), reported via FreightCaviar (https://www.freightcaviar.com/tackling-the-double-brokering-threat-insights-and-solutions-for-freight-brokers/) and TT News [NEEDS-ATTENDED-FETCH]: https://www.ttnews.com/articles/double-brokering-increases
