(2) Insure24 pharmaceutical cold chain freight insurance guide — 0.5–3% of insured values, 15–30% risk management discount: https://www.insure24.co.uk/blog/pharmaceutical-cold-chain-freight-insurance-complete-guide-to-protecting-temperature-sensitive-cargo/
(3) Parsyl Data Partner Program — Tive, Roambee, Sensitech, Berlinger, Copeland; improved coverage, rates, renewal incentives: https://www.parsyl.com/media/media/data-partner-program-launch ; AJOT coverage: https://www.ajot.com/news/parsyl-launches-new-data-initiative-with-leading-supply-chain-monitoring-providers
(4) Tive $100M booked ARR (May 2026), 4M+ trackers, 12B miles logged, 1,200+ customers: https://www.globenewswire.com/news-release/2026/05/14/3295249/0/en/Tive-Reaches-100-Million-in-Booked-ARR.html
(5) Parsyl parametric cargo insurance overview (Lloyd's syndicate partnership): https://www.artemis.bm/news/data-driven-glimpse-of-the-re-insurance-future-parametric-cargo-cover-from-parsyl/
(6) Controlant — Pfizer COVID-19 vaccine cold chain case study; <0.1% product loss; 5B+ doses deployed: https://www.controlant.com/insights/the-supply-chain-innovations-behind-the-worlds-largest-vaccine-programme ; Supply Chain Brain: https://www.supplychainbrain.com/articles/34070-ensuring-the-quality-and-safety-of-the-pfizer-vaccine-in-the-pandemic
