[ASSUMED-11]: The temperature-at-delivery data gap generates at least 5–10% of pharmaceutical and food-grade cargo claim disputes unresolvable by existing ePOD records — to validate: ask claims managers at Lloyd's cargo syndicates handling pharma reefer cargo on temperature-excursion dispute frequency and resolvability.

