(2) Nirvana Insurance telematics — up to 20% discount upfront, 30B+ miles data, $1.5B valuation December 2025: https://www.nirvanatech.com/why-telematics ; https://news.crunchbase.com/ai/insurance-platform-nirvana-valuation-nearly-doubles/ ; Samsara integration: https://www.samsara.com/resources/marketplace/nirvana-insurance
(3) Overhaul exclusive insurance program 50–65% discount vs. market for platform users: https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/overhaul-combines-its-cargo-theft-prevention-and-recovery-services-with-an-exclusive-cargo-insurance-program-302220417.html
