(8) FreightWaves — telematics rising in trucking insurance underwriting (primarily liability/APD, not standalone cargo): https://www.freightwaves.com/news/telematics-on-the-rise-in-trucking-insurance-underwriting ; https://reliancepartners.com/freightwaves/telematics-is-changing-the-game-in-trucking-insurance-underwriting/
(9) Carrier Management — why telematics integrations in insurance fail (integration complexity, data standardization): https://www.carriermanagement.com/features/2025/11/24/281755.htm
(10) Loadsure embedded insurance and AI underwriting model: https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/financial-services/loadsure-data-drive-insurance-claims-ai-eliminates-manual-processing/
