[ASSUMED-11]: No OJK, BNM, or OIC insurance product filing for a parametric cargo insurance product exists as of May 2026 — to validate: search product filings with each regulator and ask Tokio Marine and Bolttech product teams whether they have initiated regulatory dialogue on parametric cargo.

